# Cultural Landscape Report, Treatment & Management Plan: Little Round Top (2012), second reading, chapters 2 and 3 and the bibliography
# Pages read in this pass: 36 and 39-45 (site history after the battle and the dated lists of features by period), 57, 61, 73, 78-80, 83, 85 and 90 (existing conditions: fences, walls, monuments),
# 173 (the park's research file). Filed after 72-clr-lrt.xdef and 73-clr-lrt-ch4.xdef so that no earlier extract id moves.
# State dates: a feature of a later period is marked '!' (never drawn in the 1863 scene); a modern or restored state is marked '~' (only a marked inference); the walls and fences of 2010-11 are mostly rebuilt.
# The text layer lost the ti and tt glyphs; every quote is typed with the groups ti tt tf ft tl ff ignored on both sides (text_defect ligature).
