36 | woodlots | Tree lines of 1863 not strictly maintained after 1895; views from the summit narrowed | - | ~1895-1938 (commemorative era; the later narrowing of the viewshed) | stated | The report says that tree lines present at the time of the battle in 1863 were not strictly maintained and that photographs show the viewshed to the northwest and southwest of the summit progressively narrowed | =Tree lines present at the time of the battle in 1863 were not strictly maintained and photographs show evidence that the viewshed to the northwest and southwest of the summit progressively narrowed.
