173 | general | The park's file "Sheet 22: Wheatfield, Little Round Top and Devil's Den" cross-references the 1863 features (fences, fields, orchards, woods, walls) against first-hand accounts | - | 1863-07 (documentation held by the park; not among the files read here) | stated | The report's bibliography points to a manuscript of the park historians, Sheet 22, associated with the park's cultural resources map, which cross-references landscape features of 1863 (fences, fields, orchards, woods, walls) against first-hand written accounts; the manuscript itself was not among the files read | =See particularly, the manuscript prepared by park historians titled, “Sheet 22: Wheatfield, Little Round Top and Devil’s Den.” This is documentation associated with the park’s cultural resources map and cross-references landscape features of 1863 (fences, fields, orchards, woods, walls, etc.) against first-hand written accounts.
